  "56:96": {
   "page": 537,
   "text": "فَسَبِّحۡ بِٱسۡمِ رَبِّكَ ٱلۡعَظِيمِ",
   "tr": "So exalt the name of your Lord, the Most Great."
  },
  "58:1": {
   "page": 542,
   "text": "قَدۡ سَمِعَ ٱللَّهُ قَوۡلَ ٱلَّتِي تُجَٰدِلُكَ فِي زَوۡجِهَا وَتَشۡتَكِيٓ إِلَى ٱللَّهِ وَٱللَّهُ يَسۡمَعُ تَحَاوُرَكُمَآۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ سَمِيعُۢ بَصِيرٌ",
   "tr": "Certainly has Allāh heard the speech of the one who argues [i.e., pleads] with you, [O Muḥammad], concerning her husband and directs her complaint to Allāh. And Allāh hears your dialogue; indeed, Allāh is Hearing and Seeing."
  }
